30dc21e0aec4b643a71dfaa\n- Not reproducible in: 4.5.1.stable, 4.6.dev4\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.dev (1667e6fcceba0908f30dc21e0aec4b643a71dfaa) - Fedora Linux 43 (KDE Plasma Desktop Edition) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090 (nvidia; 580.95.05) - AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 62.33 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nFollowing the merge of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112011, I get this build error with `builtin_zstd=no` on Fedora 43:\n\n```\n./core/io/delta_encoding.cpp: In static member function 'static Error DeltaEncoding::encode_delta(Span<unsigned char>, Span<unsigned char>, Vector<unsigned char>&, int)':\n./core/io/delta_encoding.cpp:66:9: error: 'ZSTD_parameters' was not declared in this scope; did you mean 'ZSTD_dParameter'?\n   66 |         ZSTD_parameters zstd_params = ZSTD_getParams(p_compression_level, p_new_data.size(), p_old_data.size());\n      |         ^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n      |         ZSTD_dParameter\n./core/io/delta_encoding.cpp:67:9: error: 'zstd_params' was not declared in this scope\n   67 |         zstd_params.fParams.contentSizeFlag = 1;\n      |         ^~~~~~~~~~~\n./core/io/delta_encoding.cpp:70:23: error: 'ZSTD_CCtx_setParams' was not declared in this scope; did you mean 'ZSTD_CCtx_setParameter'?\n   70 |         zstd_result = ZSTD_CCtx_setParams(zstd_context, zstd_params);\n      |                       ^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n      |                       ZSTD_CCtx_setParameter\n./core/io/delta_encoding.cpp: In static member function 'static Error DeltaEncoding::decode_delta(Span<unsigned char>, Span<unsigned char>, Vector<unsigned char>&)':\n./core/io/delta_encoding.cpp:94:30: error: 'ZSTD_findDecompressedSize' was not declared in this scope; did you mean 'ZSTD_getDecompressedSize'?\n   94 |         size_t zstd_result = ZSTD_findDecompressedSize(p_delta.ptr() + DELTA_HEADER_SIZE, p_delta.size() - DELTA_HEADER_SIZE);\n      |                              ^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n      |                              ZSTD_getDecompressedSize\n```\n\n**Edit:** It turns out it's not related to `scu_build=all`, but `builtin_zstd=no`. The version in Fedora 43 repositories (1.5.7) is the latest still, so I don't know what could cause that.\n\ncc @mihe \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Try to compile Godot with `scons builtin_zstd=no` on Fedora 43.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113216/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113216/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}